│
├── dev workspace
│      └── dev state
│
├── staging workspace
│      └── staging state
│
└── prod workspace
       └── prod state

This allows you to keep environments separated.
Important: A workspace is not the same thing as an AWS account or EC2. It is a Terraform management boundary.
























